Third-party components

This repository contains no vendored third-party source. The ESP32 firmware
in `_sketch/` depends on external libraries that you install yourself through the
Arduino IDE / PlatformIO, and which remain under their own licenses:

| Component                                       | Provider / License                              |
| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| DW3000 UWB driver (`dw3000.h`, `dw3000_port.h`) | Makerfabs / Qorvo (Decawave)                    |
| ESPAsyncWebServer                               | External library; remains under its own license |
| AsyncTCP                                        | External library; remains under its own license |
| Arduino core for ESP32                          | Espressif                                       |

The UWB frame structures in `_sketch/*/uwb_module.*` follow the published IEEE 802.15.4
wire format. Bundled fonts (Archivo, Poppins) are licensed under the SIL Open Font License;
see their upstream distributions for full terms.
